Troubleshooting


##Permission Denied

bash: ./script.sh: Permission denied

Fix:

chmod +x script.sh


##Command Not Found Inside Script

Validate command:

which systemctl

Use correct syntax.

Bad:

"sudo systemctl status sshd"

Good:

sudo systemctl status sshd

A quoted sequence can be interpreted as one command name instead of a command with arguments.

##Variables Not Expanding Correctly

Use:

echo "$variable"

Validate variable content:

declare -p variable

Run debug mode:

bash -x script.sh
